     3115     if xShowCrsa      Then DO: KK = KK + 1. End.
     3116     if xShowCrsaNds   Then DO: KK = KK + 1. End.
     3117     if xShowSale      Then DO: KK = KK + 1. End.
     3118     if xShowSaleNds   Then DO: KK = KK + 1. End.
     3119     if xShowSaleslt   Then DO: KK = KK + 1. End.
     3120     if xShowmediator  Then DO: KK = KK + 1. End.
     3121     if x-tog-wt       then do: KK = KK + 1. End.
     3122     if x-tog-ms       then do: KK = KK + 1. End.
     3123     if xDens          then do: KK = KK + 1. End.
     3124     repeat i = 1 to 13 :
     3125       if i = 7 then next.
     3126       if NOT xShowCost      and i = 2   Then  next.
     3127       if NOT xShowCostNDS   and i = 3   Then  next.
     3128       if NOT xShowCrsa      and i = 5   Then  next.
     3129       if NOT xShowCrsaNds   and i = 6   Then  next.
