     3439     if xDens          then do: KK = KK + 1. End.
     3440     repeat i = 1 to 13 :
     3441       if i = 7 then next.
     3442       if NOT xShowCost      and i = 2   Then  next.
     3443       if NOT xShowCostNDS   and i = 3   Then  next.
     3444       if NOT xShowCrsa      and i = 5   Then  next.
     3445       if NOT xShowCrsaNds   and i = 6   Then  next.
     3446       if NOT xShowSale      and i = 8   Then  next.
     3447       if NOT xShowSaleNds   and i = 9   Then  next.
     3448       if NOT xShowSaleSlt   and i = 10  Then  next.
     3449       if NOT xShowmediator  and i = 4   Then  next.
     3450       if not x-tog-wt       and i = 11  then  next.
     3451       if not x-tog-ms       and i = 12  then  next.
     3452       if not xDens          and i = 13  then  next.
     3453       assign
     3454         LL = LL + 1
     3455         l-nk = mp-1
     3456       .
     3457     if x-vat or i <> 2  then do:
